  {
   "id": "n012",
   "legacy_id": "E4",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "level": "L2",
   "content": {
    "text": "Imports of untariffed semiconductors and computers have risen substantially, driven by AI data-center construction, and the semiconductor 232 investigation largely exempts chips imported for domestic use.",
    "label": null,
    "explicit": true,
    "reason": "Demand booms in untaxed categories can offset falls in taxed ones."
   },
   "source": {
    "passages": [
     {
      "paragraph_id": "p14",
      "paragraph_sha256": "sha256:c8dcff67ff9bbf2a0b57943994a17f6d11c6984a7e9db4f0462225df1d69df3d",
      "relation": "states",
      "link_method": "llm_citation",
      "anchor_grade": "excerpt",
      "review_status": "pending",
      "source_excerpt": "On the other hand, imports of semiconductors and computers are up substantially. Neither category has yet faced any real tariffs.",
      "source_spans": [
       {
